{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/822774a2acc7afc161ff734634cd2b87.poster.avif?t=1763116270\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/822774a2acc7afc161ff734634cd2b87.webm?t=1763116270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/ad80de9a89404a8fb0ea3a526dcad04c.avif?t=1763116270\" width=616 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Memories with You is a fun visual novel, the final part in the &quot;to You&quot; game series. Meet familiar characters Arlequina and Alicia in their new roles, play through a series of stories, and help the main character, Mitch, find love among three hot girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/42d32e405d48febc0c28e47a2c4ded68.poster.avif?t=1763116270\" width=300 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/42d32e405d48febc0c28e47a2c4ded68.webm?t=1763116270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/182698b7d37bbf3a36c7e2fd8d5e6884.webp?t=1763116270\" width=300 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/d7c338c1ec7cbbb7a223e57404d21d9f.avif?t=1763116270\" width=641 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The main character, whose life suddenly ended up on the edge because of a terrible diagnosis, spends his last days in a bar, trying to drown the pain with alcohol and memories. His youth was full of missed opportunities, unfulfilled feelings, and shattered hopes. But everything changes when a mysterious girl in a seductive circus outfit sits next to him. She calls herself Arlequina \u2014 a charismatic and enigmatic figure who offers the hero a chance to make things right and change his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With Arlequina\u2019s magical cards, he\u2019s granted the ability to travel back into his past and reconnect with three women whose hearts he once failed to win. Each is utterly unique: from a fiery schoolteacher to a bold fitness enthusiast. But this journey won\u2019t be easy. To change his fate, he will have to play thrilling card games, uncover their personalities, and defeat them in battles of wits. And victory will bring not only passionate moments but also new perspectives for his future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/fa2b5f83d80eed11f37823c3f40e1023.poster.avif?t=1763116270\" width=310 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/fa2b5f83d80eed11f37823c3f40e1023.webm?t=1763116270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/7fbae7ed2677e4950eb8270cd6b346a0.avif?t=1763116270\" width=1280 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/182698b7d37bbf3a36c7e2fd8d5e6884.webp?t=1763116270\" width=300 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/abea0ee7092a283aa618a7a4f6ec248b.avif?t=1763116270\" width=646 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this game, you\u2019ll experience a series of captivating stories, each centered around one of three unique girls. Every girl features her own distinctive gameplay mechanic! To win her heart, you\u2019ll need to challenge her to an exciting card game\u2014and defeat her to unlock a steamy scene and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/7cdb1a2ef7cf3a8b7415eb54b43b9d93.poster.avif?t=1763116270\" width=546 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/7cdb1a2ef7cf3a8b7415eb54b43b9d93.webm?t=1763116270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video