e circus outfit sits next to him. She calls herself Arlequina \u2014 a charismatic and enigmatic figure who offers the hero a chance to make things right and change his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With Arlequina\u2019s magical cards, he\u2019s granted the ability to travel back into his past and reconnect with three women whose hearts he once failed to win. Each is utterly unique: from a fiery schoolteacher to a bold fitness enthusiast. But this journey won\u2019t be easy. To change his fate, he will have to play thrilling card games, uncover their personalities, and defeat them in battles of wits. And victory will bring not only passionate moments but also new perspectives for his future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/fa2b5f83d80eed11f37823c3f40e1023.poster.avif?t=1763116270\" width=310 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/fa2b5f83d80eed11f37823c3f40e1023.webm?t=1763116270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/7fbae7ed2677e4950eb8270cd6b346a0.avif?t=1763116270\" width=1280 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576110/extras/182698b7d37bbf3a36c7e2fd8d5e6884.webp?t=1763116270\" width=300 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: